---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { u } from '../../lib/url';
import SectionBreath from '../../components/SectionBreath.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Services · Thorn Industries"
  description="Three services: a fixed-fee digitalisation assessment, custom software and integrations, data platforms and analytics. AI on the data you already have. Published prices, mapped to Romanian procurement thresholds."
  lang="en"
>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="surface-light pt-12 md:pt-20 pb-16 md:pb-24">
    <div class="container-page">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-y-8 md:gap-x-10">
        <div class="md:col-span-9">
          <div class="eyebrow text-forest-700 mb-8 md:mb-10">
            <span class="font-mono">001</span>
            <span class="mx-3 text-ink-300">·</span>
            Services
          </div>
          <h1 class="font-sans font-medium text-display-1 text-ink-900 hang tracking-tight">
            Three services.<br/>
            <span class="text-ink-400">Each priced on its own.</span>
          </h1>
        </div>

        <aside class="md:col-span-3 md:pt-32 md:border-l md:border-forest-100 md:pl-6">
          <div class="eyebrow text-ink-500 mb-3">Format</div>
          <div class="font-mono tabular text-ink-900 text-body-sm mb-6">Fixed fee</div>

          <div class="eyebrow text-ink-500 mb-3">Procurement</div>
          <div class="text-ink-900 text-body-sm mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            Submitted through SEAP<br/>
            DUAE ready
          </div>

          <div class="eyebrow text-ink-500 mb-3">Discovery</div>
          <div class="text-ink-900 text-body-sm leading-relaxed">
            Paid, not free
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 md:mt-16 max-w-2xl">
        <p class="text-body-lg text-ink-700 leading-relaxed">
          We don't bundle. Most engagements start with the assessment, because it makes things clear before the money moves. From there we build what needs building and surface the data that matters. AI doesn't fail at the model. It fails at the data underneath.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 01 - Consultancy -->
  <section id="consultancy" class="surface-medium section">
    <div class="container-page">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-10">
        <div class="md:col-span-4">
          <div class="step-numeral-lg mb-6">01</div>
          <div class="eyebrow text-forest-700 mb-3">Consultancy</div>
          <h2 class="font-sans font-semibold text-display-3 text-ink-900 leading-tight tracking-tight mb-5">
            Digitalisation<br/>assessment
          </h2>
          <p class="text-ink-600 text-body leading-relaxed">
            A written report your council or board can sign off on. One to three weeks. Fixed fee, fixed scope, fixed deliverable. AI on the data you already have. We don't start by asking for new data. We look at what is already in your systems.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="md:col-span-8 space-y-6">

          <div class="card-secondary">
            <div class="eyebrow text-forest-700 mb-4">What you get</div>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-ink-800 text-body-sm leading-relaxed">
              <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-forest-400 mt-2">·</span><span>An assessment at your offices, one to three days, looking at your current systems, your data flows and where things get stuck</span></li>
              <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-forest-400 mt-2">·</span><span>We tell you which funding lines you qualify for right now: PNRR Component 7, Regional Programme Nord-Vest, DigiLocal, NIS2 compliance grants</span></li>
              <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-forest-400 mt-2">·</span><span>The list of concrete interventions, three to seven of them, in priority order, each costed against the procurement threshold</span></li>
              <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-forest-400 mt-2">·</span><span>A 15 to 25 page written report: findings, an action plan and recommendations. You can read it without us in the room</span></li>
              <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-forest-400 mt-2">·</span><span>One follow-up working session, where we walk the decision-makers through the findings</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="card-secondary">
            <div class="eyebrow text-forest-700 mb-4">Pricing</div>
            <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
              <div>
                <div class="font-mono tabular text-2xl text-ink-900 mb-1">8K</div>
                <div class="font-mono text-eyebrow text-ink-500 mb-2">RON</div>
                <div class="text-body-sm text-ink-700 leading-snug">Small commune,<br/>single-system focus</div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="font-mono tabular text-2xl text-ink-900 mb-1">20-25K</div>
                <div class="font-mono text-eyebrow text-ink-500 mb-2">RON</div>
                <div class="text-body-sm text-ink-700 leading-snug">Town,<br/>typical project</div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="font-mono tabular text-2xl text-ink-900 mb-1">40K</div>
                <div class="font-mono text-eyebrow text-ink-500 mb-2">RON</div>
                <div class="text-body-sm text-ink-700 leading-snug">County-level,<br/>multiple systems</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-forest-100 text-body-sm text-ink-500 leading-relaxed">
              Sits within the Achiziție Directă (direct award) threshold, up to 270,120 RON. A single procurement, no contract splitting.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card-secondary">
            <div class="eyebrow text-forest-700 mb-4">What we don't do here</div>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-ink-800 text-body-sm leading-relaxed">
              <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-rust-400 mt-2">·</span><span>We don't write grant applications that were decided in advance, without an independent look first</span></li>
              <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-rust-400 mt-2">·</span><span>We don't certify the work of another consultancy</span></li>
              <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-rust-400 mt-2">·</span><span>We don't sell an AI pilot to see what comes out. We look at the data first</span></li>
              <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-rust-400 mt-2">·</span><span>We don't deliver decks. We deliver a written document, with named accountability and dates</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <SectionBreath label="Build phase" tone="light" />

  <!-- 02 - Software -->
  <section id="software" class="surface-light section">
    <div class="container-page">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-10">
        <div class="md:col-span-4">
          <div class="step-numeral-lg mb-6">02</div>
          <div class="eyebrow text-forest-700 mb-3">Software</div>
          <h2 class="font-sans font-semibold text-display-3 text-ink-900 leading-tight tracking-tight mb-5">
            Custom software<br/>& integrations
          </h2>
          <p class="text-ink-600 text-body leading-relaxed">
            Modules that solve real problems in your day-to-day work. Built on open standards. Maintenance is part of the contract.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="md:col-span-8 space-y-6">
          <div class="card-secondary">
            <div class="eyebrow text-forest-700 mb-4">Where we focus</div>
            <dl class="space-y-5 text-body-sm">
              <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-[160px,1fr] gap-3 sm:gap-6">
                <dt class="text-forest-800 font-medium">Public-sector modules</dt>
                <dd class="text-ink-700 leading-relaxed">Debt collection (executări silite), equipment & fleet (utilaje), funding line tracking. Built to sit alongside Regista, Sobis, Avansis, not to replace them.</dd>
              </div>
              <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-[160px,1fr] gap-3 sm:gap-6">
                <dt class="text-forest-800 font-medium">Integrations</dt>
                <dd class="text-ink-700 leading-relaxed">ANAF (SPV, PatrimVen), SEAP, ERP and accounting platforms, document management, GIS systems.</dd>
              </div>
              <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-[160px,1fr] gap-3 sm:gap-6">
                <dt class="text-forest-800 font-medium">Web applications</dt>
                <dd class="text-ink-700 leading-relaxed">Internal tools, citizen portals, dashboards. Built to be maintained, not to look new.</dd>
              </div>
            </dl>
          </div>

          <div class="card-secondary">
            <div class="eyebrow text-forest-700 mb-4">Pricing & procurement</div>
            <dl class="space-y-5">
              <div class="border-l-2 border-forest-200 pl-5">
                <dt class="text-body-sm font-medium text-forest-800 mb-1">Module licence + setup</dt>
                <dd class="font-mono tabular text-xl text-ink-900 mb-2">15K - 130K RON</dd>
                <p class="text-body-sm text-ink-600 leading-relaxed">From one module (small commune) to several modules (mid-sized town). Fits Ofertă Unică or Achiziție Directă.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="border-l-2 border-forest-200 pl-5">
                <dt class="text-body-sm font-medium text-forest-800 mb-1">Custom build</dt>
                <dd class="font-mono tabular text-xl text-ink-900 mb-2">40K - 250K RON</dd>
                <p class="text-body-sm text-ink-600 leading-relaxed">From a single focused integration to work that touches several systems. We match the SEAP procedure to the size of the job.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="border-l-2 border-forest-200 pl-5">
                <dt class="text-body-sm font-medium text-forest-800 mb-1">Recurring maintenance</dt>
                <dd class="font-mono tabular text-xl text-ink-900 mb-2">3.5K - 6K RON / mo</dd>
                <p class="text-body-sm text-ink-600 leading-relaxed">Per primărie. Hosting, security updates, updates the law requires, business-hours support, two small changes per quarter.</p>
              </div>
            </dl>
          </div>

          <div class="card-secondary">
            <div class="eyebrow text-forest-700 mb-4">Open standards. Your data stays yours.</div>
            <p class="text-ink-700 text-body-sm leading-relaxed">
              Public-sector deployments run on Romanian infrastructure (Romarg or ClausWeb for the data layer, as much compute as you need). Open formats, exportable schemas, no clauses that tie you to one supplier. If you ever want to move it all somewhere else, we hand over everything that is yours.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 03 - Data -->
  <section id="data" class="surface-dark section">
    <div class="container-page">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-10">
        <div class="md:col-span-4">
          <div class="step-numeral-lg mb-6">03</div>
          <div class="eyebrow text-forest-300 mb-3">Data</div>
          <h2 class="font-sans font-semibold text-display-3 text-cream-50 leading-tight tracking-tight mb-5">
            Data platforms<br/>& insights
          </h2>
          <p class="text-cream-100/70 text-body leading-relaxed">
            The reporting layer that turns your day-to-day operational data into management decisions.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="md:col-span-8 space-y-6">
          <div class="card-secondary">
            <div class="eyebrow text-forest-300 mb-4">What we deliver</div>
            <dl class="space-y-5 text-body-sm">
              <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-[180px,1fr] gap-3 sm:gap-6">
                <dt class="text-forest-300 font-medium">Data foundations</dt>
                <dd class="text-cream-100/80 leading-relaxed">We pull the data from the systems that produce it into a single trusted place, with governance rules in from the start.</dd>
              </div>
              <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-[180px,1fr] gap-3 sm:gap-6">
                <dt class="text-forest-300 font-medium">Dashboards people actually open</dt>
                <dd class="text-cream-100/80 leading-relaxed">Built with the people who use them, not for them. Two or three core views, refreshed nightly, that answer the questions asked in meetings.</dd>
              </div>
              <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-[180px,1fr] gap-3 sm:gap-6">
                <dt class="text-forest-300 font-medium">Targeted analytics</dt>
                <dd class="text-cream-100/80 leading-relaxed">Forecasting, anomaly detection, segmentation. We start from a business question and work back to the data, not the other way round.</dd>
              </div>
            </dl>
          </div>

          <div class="card-secondary">
            <div class="eyebrow text-forest-300 mb-4">Pricing</div>
            <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
              <div>
                <div class="font-mono tabular text-2xl text-cream-50 mb-1">€8K</div>
                <div class="font-mono text-eyebrow text-forest-400 mb-2">From</div>
                <div class="text-body-sm text-cream-100/70 leading-snug">A pilot dashboard,<br/>on a single data source</div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="font-mono tabular text-2xl text-cream-50 mb-1">€60K</div>
                <div class="font-mono text-eyebrow text-forest-400 mb-2">Up to</div>
                <div class="text-body-sm text-cream-100/70 leading-snug">Multi-source platform<br/>with governance + 3-5 dashboards</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-forest-700 text-body-sm text-cream-100/60 leading-relaxed">
              For private-sector clients no SEAP thresholds apply. For public-sector clients we match the same job to the right procurement procedure.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="surface-light section">
    <div class="container-page text-center">
      <div class="eyebrow text-forest-700 mb-6">004</div>
      <h2 class="font-sans font-medium text-display-2 text-ink-900 leading-tight mb-10 hang max-w-2xl mx-auto tracking-tight">
        Not sure which service fits?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-body-lg text-ink-700 max-w-xl mx-auto mb-12">
        Tell us the problem in your own words. We'll tell you what we'd start with, what we wouldn't, and what it would cost.
      </p>
      <a href={u('/en/contact')} class="btn-primary">
        Start a conversation
        <svg class="btn-arrow" width="14" height="10" viewBox="0 0 14 10" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M0 5h12M8 1l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
